dencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"with late-static-binding, this should not be an issue:\r\n1) use LSB to check if abstract class implements interface\r\n2) use LSB to call method.\r\n\r\nhttps://getpsalm.org/r/f7b6109ad0\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n\r\ninterface Foo {\r\n  public static function DoFooThing();\r\n}\r\n\r\nabstract class Bar {\r\n  public static function DooBarThing() : void {\r\n    if (is_a(static::class, Foo::class, true)) {\r\n      static::DoFooThing();\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Baz extends Bar implements Foo {\r\n  public static function DoFooThing() : string {\r\n    return '';\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nversions:\r\n* 6f96c66\r\n* 0beeb87 aka 1.1.7","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/897/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/897/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}